  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:286260cb8f66d895cda1c9dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嘛，预料之内的结果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6377005e184502062ab5fefe5fd09b9d3eb84cf4946404a0f822ae4c9c256bff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c557fce03a51d5500ca32522",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也收集到新的数据了。下次可不会就这样了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74baeb905a8f84a53fbdb7437f952363f1dfd4b8e895407cb7ef51bc37b377c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9614d4e4c113c4d1a7cd82b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嘁，该重新调整数据了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad376701af68244cfaa1c119ff06286006dfe40534eedc38b82b9b610a8d796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc7f4526263cd82b6eedf45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可比计算出来的最坏结果还差啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dee1430e976399fe2bc9381d4e7c98c759cad02f1e483db5caf78f8dd376f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d359e46cc41e46136a5fcce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ORayo！验证完毕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6f6c4daffcdd17b61b4cb189bab9671b41edbc0e484d5a188e0d841f578b03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3cc397ab8ddfc0a9bb4e584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欧拉，和预计的结果一样啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4832013ad443b92394abf9cd76592d75c9e6bc85686e2a46e2af85e092ce75af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f237b33015573b597f37ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表層から深層まで、\r\n全部オレの手の内ってワケだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3adf6a76f1642daf3d8b8c0a5684d52f398713b1a5a2f9ba3894f2de151ea359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde513447820061b524c1685",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オラッ、計算通りなンだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ef24c1f60358fa164dd566fe010c09aa21f7397ac5c0a4697c8bad5d5d5d542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b2b57675dab35d8a4b92d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "验证开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b6b0dd50333df3ea04c3db51183dc3639c207794f708b2b0e25c24cf2b2f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05b2b2fd50da0d0a01d3274b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逻辑的战术，已经组织好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd6bf672e2d0524a259a5a90fbc1d8b111ae42e83cd429f05f55c5867a9f5ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a44a8f0bfcad3b7edee0e0f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドロワねェ…。\r\n面白い組み合わせのレースが\r\n増えンのはありがてェが…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83114d0029e143770ab23292411033c01bf59a1b91fa73507931842004a6a827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9694bfb08c2e87e26d3001ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…前ン時より騒がしいな。\r\n企画が増えたからかァ？\r\nオレには…。…関係ねェけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ffba511b51b26d8fa8b883b80a843a8688175d02dabfe585cf53fc52b17087f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a5e4d465a2b6c4379725f74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タップのツレが持ち込ンだ\r\nミキサー…クソゴツかったな。\r\n…機材詳しいヤツだろうな、アレは",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae7ce2a2fbcb0719c447c3ca96e930953ae20df170b5ae867919879fc4e15c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acd1dba1e52dda51e9ec0b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アー…結局、首突っ込ンじまった。\r\nしかし、イイ機材揃えてたな…。\r\n腐らせねェように、使ってやるか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eab704e348b99480253334622db34d5fbaab7b99a16aad34f9b4b54e298ffc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd37138d2f428bb3cf26c64d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都被这噪音迷惑了吗……！\r\n就用我的“逻辑”来，打破这障碍——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "878c23c3c6cb37019fda071f023c0598c3a9686e0b26abc5f26965af52e07038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3a8a472b2b4e429247a4008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントミッションだとよ。\r\n裏ワザ教えてやろうかァ？\r\n…バァカ、嘘だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e3e276299ba29ebc2b8025c8d2d98a720ee87f42eccf9c2d1f8e2861969c83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58d90dcfc9bbc65a09dc4e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頂けるもんサクッと頂いて、\r\n次は――シメのラーメン？\r\nいらねェよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acc21861553e770f22aa54b1a208dd56efacb8d45bd7152643ab44e59312adfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160fd6cc2fe4b9b8596c878b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッ、アポカリプスといくかァ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d035d5e613a8e3caf410a2e3de5f4db97409e528d56ad88e519bfa124488549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88298a2242f9aef67679010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踏み入ったからには……覚悟はできてンだろうなァ？\r\nハッ、悪夢を始めようぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7057e34a77835af1779b188b0171cae67f0186ccee49554dfbb365af7e654f2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c7db5b60d55d2f9486acdd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハァ…やっぱオレのセリフ\r\n多すぎンだろ。アー…クソ。\r\n…勝手に抜くか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d2dfa69ef1d2d957c459d1e7a03a3eb63ca4e63a63c9e9d54cd93aaaa0f93a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e10ef578744184e8154d09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行こうぜ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "130cfbda7761e12140a9e7ed2452a9dd48d1261264b40f625fbef9b5893f435e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6742da0abf9fe459c52b6d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb9ee5b9b253f3633d60a952a705d1b4f7735fdd9d390245615ca920b83cf0f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3ee1baff1e14cc0afff09c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d4b2f7f63c553ce6ac99d702c4373da79a0dcdaf2106415e5c37f9a82e3025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a88d7628b87d9230ac1b3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d4b2f7f63c553ce6ac99d702c4373da79a0dcdaf2106415e5c37f9a82e3025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aa59c23842d77c992dba62a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へッ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e820ef4820a1da20f09946ca9271fd8ce2e45274f109ccd3971c2cb9b7f751c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0917cbe9123fcf29667b16f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へッ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e820ef4820a1da20f09946ca9271fd8ce2e45274f109ccd3971c2cb9b7f751c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2caf68c7585e5588fa36728a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はーァ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca70b0126125c7ebcef2611d8f1148a1cbec60faa3570cfaf561c0d52fe41b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66335840abef4296abcd554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はーァ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca70b0126125c7ebcef2611d8f1148a1cbec60faa3570cfaf561c0d52fe41b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
